    # ------------------------------------------------------------------- reels
    # THREE spokes on a 48-segment rim: 48 = 3 x 16, so a third of a turn maps the
    # reel exactly onto itself.  The spin interpolator sweeps only that third per
    # cycle, which is what lets a beat-aligned stop freeze at the identity rotation
    # and lets a later PLAY resume with no visible hop.
    #
    # ReelParts is DEF'd INSIDE the left reel's placement Transform.  A DEF also
    # instantiates where it stands, so defining it at the root would leave a third
    # reel floating at the origin.
